photo per piece.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-3",label:"Client gallery for a wedding photographer",prompt:"Build me a private gallery where couples view their wedding photos and favourite the best ones.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-4",label:"Portfolio dashboard for a crypto investor",prompt:"Build me a crypto portfolio tracker with coin, quantity, buy price, and profit/loss per holding.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-5",label:"Listing site for a real estate agent",prompt:"Build me a listing site with photos, price, and beds per property.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-6",label:"Tutor marketplace for a single subject",prompt:"Build me a marketplace for math tutors with profiles, rates, and a session request form.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-7",label:"Directory site for cafes in a city",prompt:"Build me a directory of independent cafes with photos, neighborhood, and hours.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-8",label:"Digital menu for a coffee shop",prompt:"Build me a digital menu for a coffee shop with drinks by category, photo, and price.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-9",label:"Class scheduler for a yoga studio",prompt:"Build me a weekly class schedule for a yoga studio with one-tap signup.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-10",label:"Portfolio and booking site for a tattoo artist",prompt:"Build me a portfolio site for a tattoo artist with a gallery and design request form.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-11",label:"Loyalty punch card for a coffee shop",prompt:"Build me a digital punch card where customers earn a free drink every 10 purchases.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"fullstack-12",label:"Wholesale order form for an indie food brand",prompt:"Build me a wholesale order form where retailers browse flavors and submit orders.",category:"fullstack"},{id:"mobile-1",label:"Job tracker for a handyman",prompt:"Build me a job tracker where each job has the customer's address, time, and before/after photos.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-2",label:"Pop-up market checkout for a vendor",prompt:"Build me a checkout app with a product grid where the seller taps to add items to a cart.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-3",label:"Lead capture app for an event booth",prompt:"Build me a lead capture app where a booth worker types in a contact and tags interest.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-4",label:"Booking app for a personal trainer",prompt:"Build me a booking app where clients request session slots and the trainer approves them.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-5",label:"Inventory count app for a small shop owner",prompt:"Build me a stock-count app where the owner taps each product to update its count.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-6",label:"Daily revenue log for a food truck",prompt:"Build me a daily log for a food truck with sales total, location, and a weekly chart.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-7",label:"Site walkthrough app for a contractor",prompt:"Build me a punch-list app where the contractor adds items with a photo and assigned trade.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-8",label:"Shot-list app for a wedding photographer",prompt:"Build me a shot-list app where the photographer ticks off must-have shots as captured.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-9",label:"Mobile estimate sender for a freelance pro",prompt:"Build me an estimate app where a freelancer picks line items and generates a PDF.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-10",label:"Tip pool tracker for a restaurant manager",prompt:"Build me a tip pool tracker that splits the day's tips by each server's hours.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-11",label:"Route app for a delivery driver",prompt:"Build me a route app where the driver adds stops and the app orders them by shortest route.",category:"mobile"},{id:"mobile-12",label:"Mobile signup app for a class instructor",prompt:"Build me a signup app where an instructor posts weekly classes and students claim spots.",category:"mobile"}],Xfs=["23945418867","120245442805260106"],Yfs=[{slug:"instant-quote-widget",label:"Instant Quote Widget",prompt:"Build me a quote tool I can embed on my website. A homeowner answers 3 quick questions - type of work, rough size, and postcode - and instantly sees a price range. Their name and number go into a simple leads table in an admin panel. Mock login for admin."},{slug:"invoice-sender",label:"Invoice Sender",prompt:"Build me a web app where I can create a simple invoice - client name, list of line items, total - and send it to the client as a PDF. The client sees a clean payment page with a Pay Now button. I can see all invoices and their paid/unpaid status in an admin view. Mock logins for now."},{slug:"lead-review-dashboard",label:"Lead & Review Dashboard",prompt:"Build me a one-page dashboard where I can see all my leads, drag them through stages (New, Quoted, Won, Lost), and when I mark a job as Won it shows a one-click button to copy a Google review request message for that client. Mock login for now."},{slug:"client-job-portal",label:"Client Job Portal",prompt:"Build me a client portal where a homeowner logs in and sees the current status of their job, what stage it's at, and any documents I've shared like quotes or invoices. I update the status and upload docs from an admin panel. Mock logins for client and admin."},{slug:"crew-weekly-scheduler",label:"Crew Weekly Scheduler",prompt:"Build me a weekly job planner where I can create jobs, assign each one to a crew member, and see the whole week on a simple grid. Each crew member has their own login and sees only their jobs for the week. Mock logins for now."},{slug:"contractor-landing-page",label:"Contractor Landing Page",prompt:"Build me a clean one-page contractor website with a hero section and a list of services. Their details go into a leads table I can view in an admin panel. Mock login for admin."},{slug:"job-cost-tracker",label:"Job Cost Tracker",prompt:"Build me a job costing tool where I create a job with a budget, then log materials and l